### Create FAQ group
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/faq/groups?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

{
  "code": "orders",
  "name": "Orders",
  "position": 0
}

> {% client.global.set("FAQ_GROUP_ID", response.body.id); %}

### Create FAQ entry
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/faq?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

{
  "content": {
    "code": "faq-track-order",
    "type": "FAQ",
    "name": "How can I track my order?",
    "title": "How can I track my order?",
    "description": "Open your account and select the order.",
    "slug": "track-order",
    "noIndex": false
  },
  "groupId": {{FAQ_GROUP_ID}},
  "position": 0,
  "references": [{"kind": "PAGE", "value": "orders"}]
}

> {% client.global.set("FAQ_ID", response.body.content.id); %}

### List group entries
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/faq?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&groupId={{FAQ_GROUP_ID}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

### Atomic reorder — duplicate membership returns 422
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/faq/order?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}

{
  "groupId": {{FAQ_GROUP_ID}},
  "orderedFaqIds": [{{FAQ_ID}}, {{FAQ_ID}}]
}

### Second store cannot address the first store's group
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v2/private/content/faq?store={{STORE_ID_2}}&lang={{LANG}}&groupId={{FAQ_GROUP_ID}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SELLER_SESSION_ID}}
